\newlabel{expand_shrink}{{4}{4}{Illustration of data-free quantization process as a zero-sum game between generator G (\textcolor [RGB]{0,112,192}{player 1}) and quantized network Q (\textcolor [RGB]{255,0,0}{player 2}). G generates the sample with large adaptability by maximizing $\mathcal  {R}(\cdot ,\cdot )$ during the maximization process, such sample adaptability is further reduced by minimizing $\mathcal  {R}(\cdot ,\cdot )$ during the minimization process when calibrating Q. }{}{}}
